 the peace by the river is really nice. But living in a Japanese mansion surrounded by that city skyline must be stunning. The views must be amazing!\n[S10T7] (dia_id: D10:7)\n\nCalvin: Ah, it really is beautiful. Whenever I look out the windows and see the city lights, it's so awe-inspiring. Luxury and beauty on a whole new level. Look at the front part of the mansion.\n[Image caption: a photo of a large house with a lot of windows and lights]\n[S10T8] (dia_id: D10:8)","text_sha256":"ebd8e55a8dd9bce6451a3a6065f82c919f526df670b23ff467cb36a04470b8aa","timestamp":"2023-07-07T19:56:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":709,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":14717,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":15426},"model":{"requested_model":"coding","served_models":["qwen3.8:27b"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc9591563dbfa","orchestration_actions_sha256":"3fa6b1160c2f7f9b2a8b3e232721d4ca78a161abb31af0d4f1f2e307b7354581","paper_prompt_id":"refind-appendix-a-stage1-plus-temporal-normalized-v1","paper_prompt_sha256":"20422063cc471ee1de75c38e4250e1a141a731ea2970786a6c715dc3c83cf7de"},"protocol_version":"shared-evidence-bundle-v1","question":{"conversation_id":"conv-50","question":"What did Calvin and his friends arrange for in the park?","question_id":"conv-50-q089","question_set_id":"locomo-conv50-extension20-v2","run_position":16,"schema_version":1},"question_sha256":"8414dba784a1c4e1ec3ff5e59c005659032d2dbd19844abf88cd9f9b4b63c779","runtime_contract":{"evidence_budget_limit":16000,"evidence_budget_un